## The evidence

From F:\Work\voice-demo, session 20260831-000635-f56d (ended 01:59 UTC):

  command.detached | {"command": "cd asteroid && ...python.exe -m http.server 8000",
                      "log": "...\.shamsu\processes\1788135549-5614.log"}

Checked at 08:20 local, over two hours later:

  LocalPort OwningProcess
  --------- -------------
       8000         19776

  ProcessId : 10520   CreationDate : 8/31/2026 6:19:09 AM   -m http.server 8000
  ProcessId : 19776   CreationDate : 8/31/2026 6:19:09 AM   -m http.server 8000

Both stopped by hand:
  SUCCESS: The process with PID 19776 (child process of PID 10520) terminated.
