## Why nothing could have cleaned it up

  _DETACHED            in-memory dict, dies with the interpreter
  atexit only          does not fire on window close / kill / crash
  log filename         <timestamp>-<hash>.log  - does not name the process
  .shamsu/dev-servers.json   absent (dev_server.py is not on the run_command path)

## After

